| `smog_index_test.mbt` / `A-5.1: degenerate text gives 3.1291 except the empty string` | `"   \n\t "`、`" .? "`、`" "`、`"\n"`、`"..."`、`"!?!"` 全部 `== 3.1291` 且 `!= 0.0`；`""` `== 0.0` |
