### 4.1 首次尝试：builtin `Double::pow` 触发两条 deprecated 警告

```console
$ cd lib && moon check --target native
Warning (deprecated): Use `@math.pow` instead   # smog_index.mbt 与测试各一条
Finished. moon: ran 3 tasks, now up to date (2 warnings, 0 errors)
```

`moon ide peek-def Double::pow` 指向
`core/builtin/double_pow_nonjs.mbt:135`，其上一行是
`#deprecated("Use `@math.pow` instead")`。与“零警告”验收冲突，故改用
